S(z) = \tan\biggl\{\frac{1}{2}\arctan\biggl[\frac{\vartheta_{00}(z)^2}{2\vartheta_{00}(z^5)^2} - \frac{1}{2}\biggr]\biggr\}^{\frac{1}{5}} \cot\biggl\{\frac{1}{2}\arccot\biggl[\frac{\vartheta_{00}(z)^2}{2\vartheta_{00}(z^5)^2} - \frac{1}{2}\biggr]\biggr\}^{\frac{2}{5}}

